<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-9788] ML: IgniteDataset op is not loaded in TensorFlow worker</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-9788</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Due to late changes in TensorFlow master (third-party library used by &quot;TensorFlow on Apache Ignite&quot;) worker code now requires explicit import of operations declared in contrib package.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;We have to explicitly import&#160;IgniteDataset op.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
